              "id": "text-14",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium 6-2-4-2 (6Al-2Sn-4Zr-2Mo) is an alpha-beta titanium alloy that is capable of being heat treated to higher strengths in larger section sizes than 6Al-4V Grade 5. Typically found in forged components, 6Al-2Sn-4Zr-2Mo forged material demonstrates greater strength, ductility and a good combination of low-cycle fatigue and fatigue-crack growth resistance. 6Al-2Sn-4Zr-2Mo is normally used in the intermediate compressor stages of turbine engines for disks, blades, seals and other airframe parts."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium Industries’ offers a wide range of products and services."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Titanium Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-titanium-round-bar) | [Titanium Plate](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-titanium-plate) | [Titanium Sheet](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-titanium-sheet)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "column-13",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "text-15",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Titanium 6Al-2Sn-4Zr-2Mo Applications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "High-temperature jet engines"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Gas turbine compressor components Blades, Discs, Spacers and Seals"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "High performance automotive valves"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Sheet metal parts in afterburners and hot airframe sections"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
